  "prefLabel": "En 402.11 Incumbent local exchange carrier (ILEC)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 402.11 “Incumbent local exchange carrier (ILEC)” means an entity, and its successors and assigns, authorized under law or by the commission before July 23, 1995, to provide telephone exchange service.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
